Comment: 0,0:05:28.97,0:05:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,————OPJP————
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:33.97,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(526,513)\blur5}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:38.73,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:43.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)}そうね、愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:49.91,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:55.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:06:00.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:05.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:05.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fs35\pos(780,2)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:10.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:15.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:20.44,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:25.15,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:30.20,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか君が死んじゃうって
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:38.83,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:41.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:41.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fs35\pos(770,2)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:43.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:46.34,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:48.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:53.85,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.97,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Comment: 0,0:05:28.97,0:05:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,————OPCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:33.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fsp4\fad(526,513)\blur5\fad(200,200)}永恒的爱到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:38.73,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,476)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fsp4}翻遍字典都毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:43.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,430)\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}是啊、爱到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:49.91,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,520)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}或许这份道不清说不明的痛楚便是爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:55.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(524,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}有开始便会创造结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:06:00.08,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}神明真是残忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:05.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}作为人类的我们定是生性勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:10.26,OPCN,,0,0,10,,{\blur5\fad(200,516)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}即便知道会走向结束也不断迈步前行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:15.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}无论付出什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:20.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}这双肮脏的双手早已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:25.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}充斥着无异于遗憾的负罪感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:30.20,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}隐藏的道路将会延续到何处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.58,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}一想起你终有一日会死去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:38.83,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我就万分痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:41.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(526,0)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}让我心碎的人究竟是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:43.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(0,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}你便是所谓的爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:46.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}尽管会将二人分离的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:48.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}始终都会来临
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:53.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}我也会以迅雷不及掩耳之势
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.97,OPCN,,0,0,5,,{\blur5\fad(200,500)\fad(200,200)\fsp4}逃脱给你看
Comment: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDJP————
Comment: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:11.35,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}誰よりも強くなると決めた
Comment: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:14.22,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self goodbye
Comment: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:26.53,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いけない
Comment: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:31.32,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You know I don’t want to lose anything
Comment: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:35.58,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Comment: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.42,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Comment: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:44.59,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Comment: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:49.55,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Comment: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:55.81,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Comment: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:59.73,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Comment: 0,0:23:00.27,0:23:04.98,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Comment: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:06.86,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Goodbye old self
Comment: 0,0:23:06.86,0:23:11.57,EDEN,换日文了,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Comment: 0,0:23:11.57,0:23:14.74,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Hello new me, this time
Comment: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,————EDCN————
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:11.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已决定变得比周遭都坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:14.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再见  曾经的我  再也不见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:26.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}选择乐生存的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:31.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}即便看不到去路前方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:35.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}比一切都要更加重要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}想感受无法释怀的温存
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:44.59,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我深知我的无力  因而我永不言弃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:49.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}就算快要窒息  我也要守护住现在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:55.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我已决定变得比周遭都坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:59.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}我必须藏起颤抖的手  继续前行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.27,0:23:04.98,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}因为我要守护的东西给了我战胜怯弱的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:06.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再见  曾经的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.86,0:23:11.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}再也不会变回那个我努力抛之于后的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.57,0:23:14.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\b1\fsp4}你好  新生的我  此时此刻
